      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gnadenhutten%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "On March 8, 1782, Pennsylvania militiamen massacred 96 Lenape in Gnadenhutten.",
