      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gnadenhutten%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 35‑foot monument stands in the Historical Park to honor the martyrs.",
